# User-facing UI (BeatStack)

The interface is for **music creators**, not developers. All visible labels, placeholders, toasts, and empty states must be in **English**.

## Do not show on screen

- Environment variable names, file paths, or internal stack details
- Raw technical errors (`ZodError`, stack traces, hook names)
- IDE or repository setup instructions
- API keys or tokens (present or future)

## Allowed

- Brand **BeatStack**, editor actions (add node, copy prompt, save preset)
- **Suno** as the destination for copied prompts
- Clear status messages: empty canvas, preset saved, copied to clipboard

## Errors

- Short, actionable English messages ("Could not save preset", "Try again")
- Technical detail only in `console.error` during development, never in production UI

## Accessibility

- Canvas controls need `aria-label` when there is no visible text
- Document shortcuts in UI when added (e.g. Delete to remove a node)
